{"id":"04d7134ec7c768b5","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbl2approx.md","title":"有限立方体上的低次最小平方逼近","display":"df-pbl2approx — 有限立方体上的低次最小平方逼近","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbl2approx","aliases":["27-df-pbl2approx"],"display":"df-pbl2approx — 有限立方体上的低次最小平方逼近","depends_on":["[[27-df-pseudobool]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.5","source_printed_pages":"593","source_pdf_pages":"617","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbl2approx"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbl2approx</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbl2approx — 有限立方体上的低次最小平方逼近"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"593"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"617"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>；空积为1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_{n,k}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R:\\exists(a_S)_{\\substack{S\\subseteq N\\\\|S|\\le k}}\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{S\\subseteq N:|S|\\le k\\}}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\left(g(x)=\\sum_{\\substack{S\\subseteq N\\\\|S|\\le k}}a_S\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal V_{n,k}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R:\\exists(a_S)_{\\substack{S\\subseteq N\\\\|S|\\le k}}\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{S\\subseteq N:|S|\\le k\\}}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\left(g(x)=\\sum_{\\substack{S\\subseteq N\\\\|S|\\le k}}a_S\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f,g\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\quad\n\\langle f,g\\rangle_n\\coloneqq2^{-n}\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x)g(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f,g\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\quad\n\\langle f,g\\rangle_n\\coloneqq2^{-n}\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x)g(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{n,k}(f)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{g\\in\\mathcal V_{n,k}:\\forall h\\in\\mathcal V_{n,k}\\;\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}(f(x)-g(x))^2\\le\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}(f(x)-h(x))^2\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_{n,k}(f)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{g\\in\\mathcal V_{n,k}:\\forall h\\in\\mathcal V_{n,k}\\;\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}(f(x)-g(x))^2\\le\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}(f(x)-h(x))^2\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>内积正定，V为有限维线性子空间，正交投影存在唯一，故最优解集合为单例；没有预先假定待求函数存在。k≥n时精确重构。原书未归一化平方误差；乘正数2^{−n}不改变最优者。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pseudobool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（[[27-df-pseudobool]]），$N=[n]$；空积为1。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_{n,k}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R:\\exists(a_S)_{\\substack{S\\subseteq N\\\\|S|\\le k}}\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{S\\subseteq N:|S|\\le k\\}}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\left(g(x)=\\sum_{\\substack{S\\subseteq N\\\\|S|\\le k}}a_S\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall f,g\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\quad\n\\langle f,g\\rangle_n\\coloneqq2^{-n}\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x)g(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{n,k}(f)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{g\\in\\mathcal V_{n,k}:\\forall h\\in\\mathcal V_{n,k}\\;\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}(f(x)-g(x))^2\\le\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}(f(x)-h(x))^2\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1663,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbl2approx|df-pbl2approx — 有限立方体上的低次最小平方逼近]]"},{"id":"9de98dd40c837b73","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$A\\subseteq N$；$\\mathcal B_{n,1}$ 见 [[27-df-pbl2approx]]，$c_f$ 见 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]。$M_A,g_A,g_f$ 为下式定义的 $\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R$ 函数；空积为 1。"}],"outgoing":["04a7d534f0d6e0dd"]}